            }
          },
          "type": "text",
          "props": {
            "content": "Banana Republic is an MFA thesis project by Nicolas Gomez Velandia, and I had the extreme pleasure of being part of his journey. As a gameplay programmer of the project, I touched on a few meaningful gameplay features such as the shooting, quest, and objective systems. ",
            "variant": "body",
            "align": "left",
            "color": "foreground",
            "transform": "none"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "blk_f170219e",
          "layout": {
