          "type": "text",
          "props": {
            "content": "In one of my tasks, I also edited part of a reload animation to be reused as an inspection animation. The feature I was building was a tactical-shooter-style accurate reload, where the player swaps magazines instead of dropping the old one entirely and gaining a new full one infinitely.",
